===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*telh₂- (bear)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|translacioun|t=transfer, translation}}, from {{der|en|xno|translacioun}}, from {{der|en|la|trānslātiō}}, from ''trānslāt-'', the {{glossary|supine}} stem of {{m|la|trānsferō|t=to transfer, transport, transform, translate}}. Displaced native {{ncog|ang|wending}}.

